<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD FROM AUSTRALIA INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD FROM AUSTRALIA INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1996-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard from the</p>
<p>Australian innings in the one day international against South</p>
<p>Africa at St George's Park on Monday.</p>
<p>South Africa 221-8</p>
<p>Australia</p>
<p> M.Waugh not out			     115</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Cullinan b Donald	     17</p>
<p> S.Law c Rhodes b Symcox		    33</p>
<p> S.Warne lbw b Symcox			  0</p>
<p> S.Waugh not out				50</p>
<p> Extras (2lb 3nb 2w)			   7</p>
<p>Total (for three wickets in 45 overs) 222 </p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-47 2-115 3-115</p>
<p>Did not bat: Greg Blewett, Michael Bevan, Adam Gilchrist, Paul</p>
<p>Reiffel, Adam Dale, Jason Gillespie</p>
<p>Bowling: Pollock 8-0-39-0 (2nb), Kallis 5-0-21-0 (1w), Donald</p>
<p>9-1-22-1 (1w), Cronje 5-0-25-0, Symcox 10-0-65-2, Klusener</p>
<p>8-1-48-0 (1nb)</p>
<p>Result: Australia won by seven wickets.</p>
<p>Series tied 1-1 after two matches.</p>
